Text: As our results show, the choice of evaluation metric makes a great deal of difference to system training and testing. Future work will be to implement aspect speciﬁc informa- tion into an LSTM model as it has been shown to be useful in other work (Wang et al., 2016). Acknowledgements We are grateful to Nikolaos Tsileponis (University of Manchester) and Mahmoud El-Haj (Lancaster University) for access to headlines in the corpus of ﬁnancial news articles collected from Factiva.

