Page: 1
Section: 2 Related Work
Text: Peng and Jiang (2016) used a multi layer neural network to predict the stock market and found that incorporating textual features from ﬁnancial news can improve the accu- racy of prediction. Kazemian et al. (2016) showed the importance of tuning sentiment analysis to the task of stock market prediction. However, much of the previous work was based on numerical ﬁnan- cial stock market data rather than on aspect level ﬁnancial textual data.

